What this repository contains
-----------------------------
Original tooling, configuration and runtime code only:

  * a vendored copy of PS2Recomp with this project's runtime fixes,
  * the function-classification config used to translate the game,
  * a helper that extracts the game executable from a disc image the user owns.

No disc image, no extracted game executable, no generated (translated) C++, no
extracted assets and no Ghidra databases or function maps are distributed here.
All of those are produced locally by the person building the project, from a
copy of the game they own.

